+  counts in `--state` the boards each key has stood on. A key standing
+  `--after` (2) sweeps is UNACTIONED unless an `--acks` file holds a live
+  `OWED-ACK <UTC> <key> <id> [ttl=<h>] <reason>` whose id prefixes a sha the
